{"study_accession":"PRJNA145991","secondary_study_accession":"SRP007826","title":"Characterization of the small RNAome in acute myeloid leukemia and discovery of novel small RNA species by deep sequencing (Illumina)","description":"We used small RNA seq (Illumina) to characterise and quantify the miRNA and small non-coding (snc)RNA transcriptome of 38 libraries of size-fractionated RNA obtained from AML patients and normal bone marrow. We detected the expression of 765 known miRNAs and 2554 uniquely located species of sncRNAs. A total of 575 potential miRNA candidate hairpins were identified. We also identified 37 C/D Box and 51 H/ACA Box, potential novel snoRNAs. Overall design: We sequenced 38 libraries obtained from 34 cytogenetically distinct cases of AML and 1 normal bone marrow from healthy donor. Duplicate experiments, which involved 2 independent RNA size fractionation and library preparation, were performed for 2 patient samples and for the normal bone marrow.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":35,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN00709303","study_accession":"PRJNA145991","blood_class":"bone_marrow","class_from":"sample","title":"AML 1","description":"AML 1","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM777185","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2017-11-07","attributes":[["source_name","Bone Marrow"],["tissue","Bone Marrow"],["age at diagnosis","27"],["cytogenetic group","t(8;21)"],["disease","AML patient"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR330925","experiment_accession":"SRX091763","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"size fractionation","instrument_model":"Illumina Genome Analyzer II","read_count":11774476,"base_count":423881136,"first_public":"2017-11-07","experiment_title":"Illumina Genome Analyzer II sequencing: GSM777185: AML 1"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN00709304","study_accession":"PRJNA145991","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"AML 2","description":"AML 2","sex"